Is the system in question a Multia, or an AlphaStation.  Multia's only
had a small amount of on chip (the 21064 CPU) cache.  the
AlphaStations (Mustang was the code name) had 2 or 4 surface mount
cache chips.  To my knowledge the amount of cache could not be
increased, via a socket or any easy do it yourself method.

